WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:15.740
93. Yoga. The word yoga has many meanings. It can mean balance, unity, or joining. Broadly

2
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:23.100
speaking, yoga is a combination of mental and physical practices. Doing yoga is supposed

3
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:29.580
to help people achieve true understanding. It is unclear when people first began to practice

4
00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:36.780
yoga, but the concept of yoga comes from the area of India and Pakistan and may be over 5,000 years

5
00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:43.820
old. There are many different branches of yoga. We'll focus here on some basic principles they

6
00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:50.620
all share. The most important part of yoga is breathing. Yoga starts with the correct breath.

7
00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:57.500
Breathing slowly and deeply through the nose is the beginning of yoga practice. Later, people

8
00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:04.220
practicing yoga may learn more difficult breathing exercises. Once your breathing is correct, you can

9
00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:12.060
move on to doing poses. The poses, or asanas, are designed to create strength and flexibility in the

10
00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:20.220
body. This relates back to the idea of balance. As you become more used to yoga, you can do more

11
00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:28.060
challenging poses. Many people do yoga simply for the exercise. Yoga does indeed help people

12
00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:35.820
become fit and healthy. But the idea is never to compete, only to do your best and improve at your

13
00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:42.540
own rate. The difficult poses also help people learn grace under pressure. This means that,

14
00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:48.780
though the body is struggling, the mind is calm. During a yoga practice, your mind is supposed to

15
00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:55.900
be clear and empty. You think about nothing but the pose. In this way, yoga helps relieve

16
00:01:55.900 --> 00:02:02.380
mental stress. The ancient tradition of yoga has spread to every continent and has been adapted

17
00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:09.020
to many different cultures. If you walk through your town, you'll probably be able to spot a yoga

18
00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:12.140
studio. Care to try it?
